```apl
)VARS          ⍝ list all defined variable names
)FNS           ⍝ list all defined functions
)SAVE ws       ⍝ save workspace to file named ws
)LOAD ws       ⍝ load workspace from file named ws
)CLEAR         ⍝ clear all definitions from workspace
)OFF           ⍝ exit APL
```

Workspace commands start with `)` and are typed at the APL prompt (not inside code). The workspace contains all your defined variables and functions.
